1
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:06,200
Taming The Husband

2
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:08,840
Episode 20

3
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:15,800
What did I do to upset him this time?
Why is he standing so far away?

4
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:19,320
He's always like that.
Forget him for a minute. What about me?

5
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:21,920
What do you mean
it went wrong and it didn't?

6
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,880
The truth is out, so I think
you'll be free by tomorrow morning.

7
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:26,640
The trouble is, the officers took him,

8
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,960
so I couldn't get a word out of him.

9
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:31,840
Lu Ziyu was so eager to clear your name

10
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,640
that he had them all rounded up.

11
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,320
Hurry!

12
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:38,720
Hurry! Go!

13
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,960
Someone's coming.

14
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:46,840
STRONG ROOTS, FLOURISHING BRANCHES

15
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,960
Xi!

16
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,160
Xi.

17
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:56,960
If it's nothing, just go.

18
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,680
I'll only get scolded again.

19
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:00,720
Come here.

20
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,880
I dealt with Shen Qinghe last night.

21
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:06,840
Just as the letter said,

22
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:08,800
I had him exiled to Nanling

23
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:10,600
after fifty strokes of the rod.

24
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,080
You should've heard him scream.

25
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:17,800
You did what?

26
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:22,320
What? Don't tell me
you feel sorry for him.

27
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:26,640
No! Why would I feel sorry for a man? I…

28
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,800
My head's killing me.

29
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:30,920
Just get out. Get out!

30
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:33,920
Get out! Leave me alone for a while.

31
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,200
-Here.
-What's this?

32
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:40,120
STRONG ROOTS, FLOURISHING BRANCHES

33
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,920
Knee pads.

34
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,600
STRONG ROOTS, FLOURISHING BRANCHES

35
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,880
I didn't write that letter.

36
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,320
Neither did I.

37
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,880
And neither did Xie Yan.
I was with him last night.

38
00:02:57,760 --> 00:03:01,440
No wonder Lu Ziyu was in such a hurry.
He knew you'd been made to kneel here.

39
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,800
But the only people
who knew about that were the Xies.

40
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:04,880
Could it have been your mother?

41
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:06,680
She was with me last night.

42
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:14,040
-Zhou Wanjun.
-Zhou Wanjun.

43
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,600
Lady Zhou.

44
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,640
You've been spending a lot of time
with the second branch lately.

45
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,680
What's going on?

46
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,800
I went to rub it in her face.

47
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:04,280
I usually turn a blind eye to what you do.

48
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:07,080
Do you expect me to close both eyes now?

49
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:11,640
I just want to get to the bottom

50
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:13,600
of the plum drink and divination blocks.

51
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:20,840
Lady Zhou's been so good to us,
and this is how you repay her?

52
00:04:21,840 --> 00:04:23,440
I knew she came here to tell on me.

53
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:24,520
Jin Baozhu.

54
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,080
Once the door's shut,
you can make as much trouble as you like.

55
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:31,480
I only ask one thing. Respect her.

56
00:04:31,840 --> 00:04:33,040
Respect our mother.

57
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:36,600
See? I knew I shouldn't have told you.

58
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:38,600
Now I've told you, and you're angry again.

59
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,840
I'm sick of it.

60
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,160
Let me ask you this.

61
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,720
Did you lie to me?

62
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:53,920
Yes.

63
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:55,840
If I kept something from you

64
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,600
and came back reeking of powder,

65
00:04:58,880 --> 00:04:59,920
wouldn't you be angry?

66
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,000
I would.

67
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:04,840
You understood why Heng took the ledger

68
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,400
and felt sorry when Song Jingxing was hit,

69
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,880
and even when Xie Xi had to kneel,
you helped her.

70
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:10,240
You're so good at thinking of everyone.

71
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:11,400
Can't you think of me for once?

72
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:20,120
I'm sorry.

73
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,280
Go away.

74
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,040
I don't want to talk to you.

75
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:28,240
I already said I was sorry!

76
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:30,360
And why do you always tell me to leave?

77
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,760
I'm staying. You can leave.

78
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:35,960
Jin… Jin Baozhu.

79
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,320
-Move.
-Jin Baozhu!

80
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,360
Jin Baozhu!

81
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,080
Jin Baozhu!

82
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:43,760
Jin Baozhu!

83
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:57,800
I've paid back everything you put up.
You can stop going on about it.

84
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:01,920
I'm roasting.

85
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,560
If it weren't for that,
I'd never have come here.

86
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:04,960
BAOZHU'S SHOP

87
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,360
Don't see me out. Don't bother.

88
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:12,320
It's ridiculously hot.

89
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:16,000
Ten days without a drop of rain,
and now all the customers are gone.

90
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:19,560
I doubt Aunt Shen's offal stew shop

91
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:21,040
can stay open much longer.

92
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,800
CARPENTER'S SHOP

93
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:27,120
Didn't Qiao ask you
to get that letter from Lu Ziyu?

94
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:28,200
Did you get it?

95
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:30,640
It's gone.

96
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,480
Gone?

97
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,560
But it was at the Lu residence.

98
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:37,680
Could Lady Zhou really
have that much reach?

99
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:43,560
All right. If you're too hot,

100
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,560
go home after you've counted this stock.

101
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,840
As for the favors we owed,

102
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,360
we're just about even now.

103
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:50,480
I'm in no hurry.

104
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:53,120
I used to think running a shop

105
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:55,800
was all tedious little chores,
but now I'm starting to enjoy it.

106
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:58,560
With so many people coming through,
somebody's bound to see my new clothes.

107
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:02,200
Only you would think that's fun.
I'm bored to death.

108
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:04,880
Where's Yan?

109
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:07,240
-Why isn't he here today?
-Never mind him.

110
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,320
Lady Jin!

111
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:10,040
-Yingtao!
-Lady Jin!

112
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:12,640
Something urgent's come up at home,
and they want us back.

113
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,600
THE XIE ESTATE

114
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:21,480
By the Mandate of Heaven,
the emperor decrees.

115
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:25,120
"Drought has scorched the Central Plains
for a thousand li."

116
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:28,760
"Many are starving,
and the roads are full of refugees."

117
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:33,000
"Send 100,000 dan of relief grain
from Yangzhou

118
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:36,040
along the Grand Canal to Yancheng

119
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,960
with all haste to aid the stricken."

120
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:40,600
"Deliver the full amount
within one month."

121
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:44,080
"There must be no delays or shortages."

122
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:46,280
"Obey this imperial command

123
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:49,640
and carry it out faithfully."

124
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,400
A hundred thousand dan of grain

125
00:07:58,880 --> 00:08:00,960
from Yangzhou to Yancheng in one month?

126
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,160
They're not just ordering a shipment.

127
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:04,160
They're asking us to take on
an imperial commission.

128
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:17,000
Wanjun,

129
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,680
what do you think?

130
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:23,840
The Xies came out on top,

131
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:27,960
but that puts us in the hot seat,
and we can hardly refuse.

132
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:31,200
If it's a matter of reputation,

133
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:34,040
the Bais and Zhangs have standing, too.

134
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:35,880
Captain, have you asked them?

135
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,960
I have.

136
00:08:38,040 --> 00:08:41,360
They claimed their ships were damaged,

137
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:44,400
they lacked men and couldn't manage it,

138
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:47,040
so they asked the court to appoint others.

139
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:50,080
The water route from Yangzhou
to Yancheng is dangerous,

140
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,480
and if anything goes wrong,

141
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:55,120
how can we answer for it?

142
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:15,880
What does it mean for the land
to be scorched for a thousand li?

143
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,960
The soil gets so dry it cracks,

144
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,880
and nothing grows.

145
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,920
And what does "many are starving" mean?

146
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,840
People have so little to eat

147
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:27,800
they can't even find roots
or bark to get by on.

148
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,920
Why are you asking, Lady Jin?

149
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,840
It's heartbreaking to hear.

150
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:39,240
She's trying to make us feel bad.

151
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,520
And the roads full of refugees?

152
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,480
The roads full of refugees?

153
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,600
You read it correctly,

154
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:56,160
so you must know what it means.

155
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,080
I've heard about it,

156
00:09:58,680 --> 00:09:59,840
but I've never seen it.

157
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:04,240
I do know that grain and human lives
carry real weight,

158
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:07,040
while the words of an imperial edict
weigh next to nothing.

159
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:09,360
Yet those weightless words

160
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:12,200
can decide matters of life and death.

161
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,600
Isn't that absurd?

162
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,920
If you know what it means
for the roads to be full of refugees,

163
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:23,920
you must know what it means

164
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:26,280
to fight a fire with a cup of water

165
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,280
or stand in front of a charging cart.

166
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,680
Then you must also know

167
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:35,760
how a single spark
can set a whole field ablaze.

168
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:40,160
And you know better than anyone
what "Open waterways, enrich the nation"

169
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,800
and "Pass down kindness and integrity"
mean.

170
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,320
PASS DOWN KINDNESS AND INTEGRITY

171
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,000
I heard that when Uncle Chengzong

172
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:51,560
was impeached by the court officials,

173
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:53,240
you were thrown in prison,

174
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:55,320
but you refused to yield.

175
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:59,240
You'd rather lose the use of both legs

176
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:01,720
than let the Xie name be dragged down.

177
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,320
You, Xie Yan,

178
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:06,360
were as brave and loyal as anyone.

179
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:09,160
So when did you start
hiding in your shell?

180
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:11,840
Where's that backbone of yours?

181
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:13,200
Don't talk nonsense.

182
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:16,360
Father lost his chance to hold office
because of what happened to Yan.

183
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:20,440
Then why does
your father bend over backward for him,

184
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:23,480
only to get the cold shoulder?

185
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:24,840
Heng!

186
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:29,040
Grandmother Zhan.

187
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:31,160
Heng and I had a few cups of wine today.

188
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,800
I'm afraid my headaches are back,

189
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:35,800
so I'll have Heng help me back to my room.

190
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,360
Come.

191
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:39,240
So you're saying

192
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:41,640
the Xies pride themselves on integrity,

193
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:44,120
and when the country's in trouble,

194
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:47,280
how can we sit back and do nothing?

195
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:49,560
Exactly.

196
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,760
But the route is dangerous,

197
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:55,160
and if we fail,
the court holds us responsible.

198
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:57,560
The Xies could lose in a day
what took a century to build.

199
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:02,640
Could you live with that?

200
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,840
Could I live with it?

201
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:06,720
You've carried a false charge for years.

202
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:09,400
Can you live with that
for the rest of your life?

203
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:10,840
Xie Yan.

204
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:18,600
When you were just starting out,

205
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:20,720
you came first in three exams running.

206
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,400
No one could beat you.

207
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:25,240
All that was left was the palace exam.
If you'd placed first there, too,

208
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,920
you'd have topped all three
imperial exams.

209
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:28,800
That year,

210
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:31,360
you rode through the streets

211
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:33,640
with everyone cheering for you,

212
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:36,520
and you made a bold promise.

213
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:41,200
Ministry of Revenue,
Grain Transport Bureau.

214
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:42,480
The director's son

215
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:46,080
has topped the metropolitan exam!
Join the celebrations!

216
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:48,720
-I, Xie Yan, will top all three exams
-I, Xie Yan, will top all three exams

217
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:50,320
-and come first at the palace exam!
-and come first at the palace exam!

218
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,480
Look at you now.

219
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:57,600
Pathetic.

220
00:12:58,480 --> 00:12:59,840
Ridiculous.

221
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:03,040
-Heng!
-Quick, stop them!

222
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,360
Mother!

223
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:06,520
-Heng!
-This…

224
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,560
Scraping by like this,

225
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:11,160
is that enough for you?

226
00:13:11,880 --> 00:13:12,920
It is.

227
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:16,040
You're the one who can't live with it.

228
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,880
I've always beaten you,

229
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:20,760
then and now.

230
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,880
You're afraid you'll always
come second to me.

231
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:25,680
You're afraid people will know Xie Yan
and never know Xie Heng.

232
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:27,600
-Heng!
-Heng!

233
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:29,840
If you're so happy,
why are you hitting me?

234
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:33,840
If you're so happy,
why won't you tell them

235
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:35,840
how you really lost the use of your legs?

236
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,280
If you could live with it,

237
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,800
you wouldn't be hiding here.

238
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:45,840
Xie Yan,

239
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:48,000
I have no respect for you.

240
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:50,800
You got back on your feet,

241
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:53,560
but in your heart you're still kneeling.

242
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:57,520
Enough!

243
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:59,520
Both of you, stop.

244
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:01,880
Sit down.

245
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:40,600
Heng's right.

246
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:44,760
What happened to me cost Father his post

247
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:47,320
and forced him to leave the capital.

248
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:51,600
Ever since, the Xies have lived in shame
with people talking behind our backs.

249
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:55,160
I owe our family too much.

250
00:14:57,800 --> 00:14:59,480
Now we're at odds with the Lus,

251
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:02,280
and with no connections at court,

252
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:04,720
next year

253
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:07,840
we may be in real danger.

254
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:13,880
Relief is a matter of national concern,

255
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:18,040
and if we pull this off,

256
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:21,920
it could do us a world of good.

257
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:31,320
Right now, our fleet is too small

258
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:33,840
to take all the grain
to the disaster area at once.

259
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:36,280
Let's send two fast ships ahead

260
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:38,040
with the first load of grain,

261
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:40,960
then send the rest in several batches

262
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,560
along the same route, one after another.

263
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:47,480
If we break the voyage into stages,
we can get it there safely and quickly.

264
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,440
Yan,

265
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:53,360
your father never said
any of those things.

266
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:57,360
You can't take this on in a rush
because of a few words.

267
00:15:58,240 --> 00:15:59,800
The Xie name is at stake.

268
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:03,120
Don't play the hero and rush into this.

269
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:05,240
I've never wanted to be a hero.

270
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:07,320
Land scorched for a thousand li,

271
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:10,360
people starving,
and roads full of refugees.

272
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,720
I've never heard or seen it firsthand.

273
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:15,320
Talking as if I'm doing it

274
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:17,400
for some higher cause

275
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:20,280
would be pure hypocrisy.

276
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:23,200
I'm taking the commission
for my own reasons.

277
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:24,400
So what?

278
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,720
I'll take that gamble.

279
00:16:26,800 --> 00:16:28,600
If I win, they'll honor my name forever,

280
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:30,880
and if I lose, they'll curse it forever.

281
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,520
Besides, I, Xie Yan,

282
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:39,000
was branded a disgrace
and driven out of the capital.

283
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:42,840
I can't go on hiding my whole life.

284
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:49,360
Think and do whatever you like.

285
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:57,440
Grandmother Zhan,

286
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,600
I'm taking the commission.

287
00:17:22,360 --> 00:17:24,040
Bring me the divination blocks.

288
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:27,640
-Yes.
-Mother, think this through.

289
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:56,840
It's a favorable cast.

290
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:24,440
Anyone willing to join
Xie Yan and Xie Heng

291
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:28,920
in bringing relief to the people,
please rise.

292
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:18,560
I can't go?

293
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:21,440
Women can't board grain transport ships.

294
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:23,280
That's the Xie family rule.

295
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:25,960
He's out there risking his life,

296
00:19:26,040 --> 00:19:27,880
and I'm supposed to sit
at home doing nothing?

297
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:29,000
What kind of rule is that?

298
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:31,600
Baozhu, kneel.

299
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:43,320
While he's out there risking his life,

300
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:49,520
I need you here
to look after the Xie family for him.

301
00:19:58,520 --> 00:20:01,920
-Madam Zhan!
-I'm fine. It happens all the time.

302
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:04,040
What do you mean by this?

303
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:07,440
This was passed down

304
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:10,680
from my mother-in-law to me.

305
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:13,720
Whoever wears it

306
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:16,800
will become the lady of the house.

307
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:20,000
I can't take it.
Even Lady Zhou doesn't have it.

308
00:20:22,360 --> 00:20:26,040
-She married in after the first wife died.
-But I'm only a concubine.

309
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:27,760
I can tell

310
00:20:28,320 --> 00:20:31,240
Yan will make you his principal wife

311
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:34,480
sooner or later, and the time is now.

312
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:38,160
Now?

313
00:20:38,560 --> 00:20:39,560
Baozhu,

314
00:20:40,080 --> 00:20:42,240
anything could happen on the river.

315
00:20:42,800 --> 00:20:44,280
Have you thought it through?

316
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:47,400
I don't want to think about it.

317
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:50,760
If anything goes wrong,

318
00:20:50,840 --> 00:20:52,960
you'll have to hold the family together.

319
00:20:58,400 --> 00:20:59,640
See?

320
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:05,680
Hanzhang agrees, too.

321
00:21:06,320 --> 00:21:08,920
She's Yan's birth mother,

322
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:11,080
and it only took one cast.

323
00:21:13,120 --> 00:21:16,960
It seems she thinks highly of you.

324
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:21,120
Heaven has chosen you.

325
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:24,080
This is your fate, Jin Baozhu.

326
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:59,960
Grandmother Zhan,
it's late and the dew is heavy.

327
00:22:00,520 --> 00:22:02,280
You should get some rest.

328
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:08,320
The cast I made in the main hall

329
00:22:09,800 --> 00:22:11,360
wasn't a favorable cast.

330
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:15,720
I've still got two more to ask for.

331
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:23,960
You haven't been back long,

332
00:22:25,320 --> 00:22:26,960
and you've already grown so much, Yi.

333
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:30,080
Mother, I'm still growing.

334
00:22:30,520 --> 00:22:31,920
Next time I come home,

335
00:22:33,560 --> 00:22:35,280
I'll be taller than that screen.

336
00:22:36,040 --> 00:22:38,680
All right. I'll be looking forward to it.

337
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:41,560
Mother, what would you like?

338
00:22:42,120 --> 00:22:43,840
Patterned satin or a glass vase?

339
00:22:45,400 --> 00:22:48,680
I don't want a thing
except for you both to come home safely.

340
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:50,760
Here, take this.

341
00:22:50,840 --> 00:22:52,120
Thank you, Mother.

342
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:54,760
Here.

343
00:22:56,760 --> 00:22:58,720
This one is for you,

344
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:02,400
and this one is for Yan.

345
00:23:03,600 --> 00:23:05,000
Keep an eye on Yan for me,

346
00:23:05,400 --> 00:23:08,480
and remember to wear it at all times.

347
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:10,960
I will, Mother.

348
00:23:18,600 --> 00:23:19,600
Mother,

349
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:21,520
please don't be sad.

350
00:23:24,200 --> 00:23:25,840
Qiao leaves tomorrow.

351
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:29,360
Spend a little more time talking to him.

352
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:37,000
Mother,

353
00:23:38,080 --> 00:23:39,440
I'll get some rest now.

354
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:42,520
We have to gather at the docks
first thing tomorrow,

355
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:47,000
so if you'll excuse me.

356
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:51,760
How can you be so cruel?

357
00:23:52,600 --> 00:23:53,840
What if something happens to you?

358
00:23:54,600 --> 00:23:55,760
Why can't you think

359
00:23:55,840 --> 00:23:57,320
about what this does to me?

360
00:24:02,520 --> 00:24:06,200
Mother, I don't want to see you
crying alone in your room all day.

361
00:24:07,600 --> 00:24:09,640
I want to do something for our family.

362
00:24:10,800 --> 00:24:13,240
He's going to earn some merit

363
00:24:13,800 --> 00:24:16,400
to ask Grandmother Zhan
to let you out of this room.

364
00:24:20,280 --> 00:24:21,400
Qiao.

365
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:23,160
Mother.

366
00:24:25,560 --> 00:24:27,040
You're a good son,

367
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:31,640
but while you're out there,

368
00:24:32,280 --> 00:24:34,720
you must take care of yourself.

369
00:24:35,040 --> 00:24:36,120
I will.

370
00:24:36,200 --> 00:24:37,720
Promise me

371
00:24:38,840 --> 00:24:40,440
you'll come home safe.

372
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:44,320
My dear boy.

373
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,400
Mother.

374
00:24:50,760 --> 00:24:51,760
Xi,

375
00:24:53,840 --> 00:24:56,120
I'm counting on you to look after Mother.

376
00:25:23,040 --> 00:25:25,040
I'm doing just fine now, aren't I?

377
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:28,720
What do you mean, now?
We'll be fine from now on, too.

378
00:25:30,360 --> 00:25:31,360
All right.

379
00:25:33,840 --> 00:25:35,200
Then give us a smile, Mother.

380
00:25:42,040 --> 00:25:43,040
Mother.

381
00:25:45,680 --> 00:25:47,000
I regret it.

382
00:25:47,800 --> 00:25:49,440
I really do.

383
00:25:50,560 --> 00:25:51,640
Heng,

384
00:25:52,080 --> 00:25:53,960
you shouldn't have had to suffer so much,

385
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:55,560
and it's all my fault. Mine.

386
00:25:55,640 --> 00:25:57,280
You could've… You…

387
00:26:06,320 --> 00:26:07,800
Of all the things in this life,

388
00:26:08,920 --> 00:26:10,240
having you has made me so happy.

389
00:26:15,120 --> 00:26:16,960
Promise me

390
00:26:17,480 --> 00:26:19,200
that all will go well out there

391
00:26:19,800 --> 00:26:21,720
and you'll come home safe.

392
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:23,960
I promise.

393
00:26:27,360 --> 00:26:29,840
It's the middle of the night.
What's with all the wailing?

394
00:26:29,920 --> 00:26:33,200
Think you're special
because you've got a son?

395
00:26:56,360 --> 00:26:59,080
This is something I just got
from the storeroom.

396
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:00,440
OUR ANCESTORS' DEEDS BLESS US FOREVER

397
00:27:00,520 --> 00:27:03,440
Why don't we tell Young Master Xie?

398
00:27:04,720 --> 00:27:06,080
Tell him what?

399
00:27:07,880 --> 00:27:08,880
You're right.

400
00:27:09,880 --> 00:27:11,240
We do what we can,

401
00:27:12,920 --> 00:27:14,600
and if heaven grants our wish,

402
00:27:15,080 --> 00:27:16,600
we can leave the rest to fate.

403
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:19,080
But if heaven doesn't,

404
00:27:20,600 --> 00:27:22,120
why should we listen?

405
00:27:32,840 --> 00:27:34,320
From now on,

406
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:36,200
no more lying.

407
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:40,000
All right.

408
00:27:41,200 --> 00:27:42,200
Don't go.

409
00:27:45,600 --> 00:27:46,640
All right.

410
00:27:48,120 --> 00:27:49,320
You want to make up?

411
00:27:52,280 --> 00:27:53,320
Yes.

412
00:27:55,160 --> 00:27:56,600
You can't bear to leave me?

413
00:27:58,760 --> 00:27:59,920
Yes.

414
00:28:07,640 --> 00:28:08,720
You love me?

415
00:28:09,720 --> 00:28:10,760
Yes.

416
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:17,280
From now on,

417
00:28:17,360 --> 00:28:18,360
no more lying.

418
00:28:19,560 --> 00:28:20,560
All right.

419
00:28:21,920 --> 00:28:23,200
What were you accused of?

420
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:27,560
Cheating in the imperial exams.

421
00:28:29,320 --> 00:28:30,520
You were framed and sent to prison?

422
00:28:30,600 --> 00:28:32,720
-Yes.
-So you're doing this to clear your name?

423
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:34,720
Not entirely.

424
00:28:35,240 --> 00:28:36,680
Why did you live with the accusation?

425
00:28:37,240 --> 00:28:38,480
I had no way to clear my name.

426
00:28:39,920 --> 00:28:41,520
Then why the change of heart?

427
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:43,920
I remembered something someone said.

428
00:28:44,800 --> 00:28:46,040
What was it?

429
00:28:47,280 --> 00:28:49,000
"You know nothing
about ordinary people's lives.

430
00:28:50,200 --> 00:28:51,640
Some scholar you are!

431
00:28:52,200 --> 00:28:53,440
You don't even deserve
to be called human!"

432
00:28:54,520 --> 00:28:56,760
…but nothing about ordinary
people's lives.

433
00:28:56,840 --> 00:28:58,200
Some scholar you are!

434
00:28:58,280 --> 00:28:59,880
You don't even deserve to be called human!

435
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:11,040
-You can't bear to leave me?
-Yes.

436
00:29:12,760 --> 00:29:13,880
You want to make up?

437
00:29:15,680 --> 00:29:16,680
Yes.

438
00:29:17,880 --> 00:29:19,120
You love me?

439
00:29:26,120 --> 00:29:27,640
-You love me?
-I love you.

440
00:29:40,520 --> 00:29:42,160
So why'd you come here tonight?

441
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:45,600
To take my hand cannon
and threaten me into staying?

442
00:29:47,360 --> 00:29:50,080
I came to spend the night with you.

443
00:29:50,160 --> 00:29:51,280
You…

444
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:56,080
It's a dud.

445
00:29:56,640 --> 00:29:58,040
You're still the better liar.

446
00:29:59,800 --> 00:30:01,280
So now we're even.

447
00:30:03,760 --> 00:30:06,040
I meant it about spending the night.

448
00:30:30,560 --> 00:30:33,360
Why didn't Baozhu come to see you off?
Don't tell me she couldn't get up.

449
00:30:34,360 --> 00:30:36,840
She was up all night,
so she's probably catching up on sleep.

450
00:30:37,680 --> 00:30:38,680
That makes sense.

451
00:30:38,760 --> 00:30:41,520
She must've been up late getting you ready
and worn herself out.

452
00:30:41,840 --> 00:30:43,160
She had plenty of energy.

453
00:30:43,560 --> 00:30:44,760
I'm the one who's worn out.

454
00:30:45,160 --> 00:30:47,440
Yan, how'd you get that bruise?

455
00:30:50,920 --> 00:30:53,040
She wanted to come, but I said no,

456
00:30:55,840 --> 00:30:57,880
so last night she taught me a lesson.

457
00:31:01,240 --> 00:31:03,040
How can you look so happy

458
00:31:03,200 --> 00:31:04,440
after taking a beating?

459
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:11,720
-It's taking forever!
-Just wait for it.

460
00:31:13,960 --> 00:31:15,440
You don't have a problem.

461
00:31:16,920 --> 00:31:18,680
XIE

462
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:24,640
HEREDITARY GRAIN STEWARDS
XIE FAMILY PASS

463
00:31:24,720 --> 00:31:26,080
Take off your bamboo hat.
